o = Style OR / Orig OR. The gradient is independently replicated across two judges (Spearman $\\rho = 1.0$).}\n\\label{tab:gradient}\n\\end{table}\n\nTable~\\ref{tab:gradient} formalizes the cross-axis pattern.\nThe gradient is strictly monotonic for both judges: axes with higher genuine bias (as confirmed by GEE) produce higher BT.","numLines":20,"startLine":310,"totalLines":504}}}
